sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% PATHWAY.ECO — Workflow 4: Recruiter Team Invitation, Granular RBAC & Tenant Isolation
    
    actor Admin as Company Admin (:3002)
    actor Invitee as Invited Team Member
    participant MW as Edge Middleware
    participant Auth as ServerAuth Guard
    participant RBAC as RecruiterRbacService
    participant TeamService as RecruiterTeamService
    participant DB as Prisma / MongoDB
    participant Zepto as ZeptoMail API

    Admin->>MW: POST /api/recruiter/team/invite (Cookie: career_recruiter_session)
    MW->>Auth: Pass through route (valid cookie)
    Auth->>DB: Resolve Admin & Company context
    DB-->>Auth: Admin active, role == COMPANY_ADMIN
    Auth->>RBAC: assertPermission(auth, 'team:invite')
    RBAC-->>TeamService: Authorized
    TeamService->>DB: Check duplicate active member in company
    TeamService->>DB: Check conflicting pending invitation
    
    TeamService->>TeamService: rawToken = crypto.randomBytes(32).toString('hex')
    TeamService->>DB: db.companyInvitation.create({ tokenHash = sha256(rawToken), role, expiresAt: now + 7d, status: PENDING })
    DB-->>TeamService: Invitation record committed
    TeamService->>DB: AuditLog RECRUITER_INVITATION_CREATED
    TeamService-)Zepto: sendRecruiterInvitationEmail({ acceptUrl: /team/accept-invite?token=rawToken })
    TeamService-->>Admin: HTTP 201 Created { invitation: DTO }

    Invitee->>MW: POST /api/recruiter/team/accept { token: rawToken }
    MW->>TeamService: acceptInvitation(rawToken)
    TeamService->>DB: Query db.companyInvitation (where: { tokenHash: sha256(rawToken) })
    DB-->>TeamService: Valid invitation found (expiresAt > now, not revoked)
    TeamService->>DB: Upsert User (role: 'RECRUITER') & RecruiterProfile
    TeamService->>DB: db.companyMember.upsert({ companyId, userId, role, status: 'ACTIVE', assignedJobIds, interviewTypes })
    TeamService->>DB: db.companyInvitation.update({ status: 'ACCEPTED', acceptedAt: now })
    TeamService->>DB: AuditLog RECRUITER_INVITATION_ACCEPTED
    TeamService-->>Invitee: HTTP 200 OK (Membership activated)

    Note over Invitee, DB: Every subsequent API request passes through RecruiterRbacService
    Invitee->>MW: GET /api/recruiter/applications
    MW->>RBAC: assertPermission(auth, 'applications:view_assigned')
    RBAC->>DB: Injects where: { job: { companyId: auth.company.id } }
    alt Hiring Manager Scoping
        RBAC->>DB: Injects where: { jobId: { in: auth.membership.assignedJobIds } }
    else Interviewer Scoping
        RBAC->>DB: Injects where: { interviewerId: auth.user.id }
    end
    DB-->>Invitee: Strictly isolated, permission-scoped records returned
